			<div class="content" id="post-content-1955559">
									

<p>I've now posted this SCP officially and I await the evaluation.</p>
<p>I wish to express Thanks to the following members who greatly assisted this endeavor:</p>
<p>Zyn: All credit goes to you for helping write-up the interview log and the poem at the end. I also gratefully thank you for collaborating with me and rewriting my original article and for writing of her wonderful interview and the poem all of which helped breath life into this SCP</p>
<p>I express my heart-felt and utmost gratitude for your co-authorship and spearheading of the piece.. thank you for taking the time and effort in greatly assisting me here at this site. (I'm your collab partner, man. ~Zyn)</p>
<p>Crayne: For your detailed and helpful advice and helpful and speedy critique. I'm grateful to you. You have given much depth and thought into your evaluation.</p>
<p>Vivax: For you harsh critique and feedback which helped considerably thank you. I decided to take your blunt advice as a learning experience which will help in the continuation of my evolution into a author.</p>
<p>Dr. Bright: For taking the time to read my article and giving your insightful opinions.</p>
<p>And finally with all due respect, thank you all who have offered your opinions during the drafting stages as well. I thank the entire foundation community for their assistance in my journey.</p>

